{
 "comment": "Inbound-message samples for the Photon (Stable Spectrum) webhook contract. Shape copied verbatim from the documented delivery example (photon.codes /docs/webhooks/events, verified 2026-10-17, saved in skywatch-notes): event 'messages', space.id opaque DM id, message.sender.id = sender handle, content.type 'text'. Phones are dummy E.164 values. Task 3 tests sign these payloads with the webhook secret and POST them to /webhooks/photon/message.",
 "samples": [
